|Development Team|
start
:Update torrent site database;
:Update video site databases;
|User|
:Tick torrent search box;
:Tick video host box;
:Tick video link box;
:Enter search term;
:Start search;
|Program|
if (Search type selected?) then (torrent)
|Program|
